        "created_at": "2013-03-25T06:12:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Me and some friends ended up at a spare table at the GTG booth last night (tabletop was pretty packed!).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That was you?! I was at the next table over, playing Sentinels.</p>",
